      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JUST A JOKER (2) comes off an average performance last start when sixth at Northam over 509m behind Choosing Texas (30.37) in a Grade 4/5. Should bounce back. MR FLAME (1) continues to race well but is struggling to break through, placing at his last four runs. Last start finished 3rd over 400m at this track beaten 6 lengths (22.61) behind Sunset Silence in a Grade 5 on October 29. Solid formlines coming through his last run. Hard to beat again. OFF TO SCHOOL (5) had the drop on the pace early but forged to the lead on the bend and drew clear to score (22.77) at this track in a Novice race over 400m. Expected to measure up again. ALFRED KEEPING (7) racing over this distance brings the best out in him.",
